#: ../installation/preparation.rst:8
msgid "Preparation"
msgstr "Priprema"

#: ../installation/preparation.rst:10
msgid ""
"You have to follow some preparation steps for Galette installation. The way "
"to go differs on what you want to achieve."
msgstr ""
"Prije instalacije Galettea trebate izvršiti pripremne korake. Postupak ovisi "
"o tome što želite postići."

#: ../installation/preparation.rst:15
msgid "Archive contents"
msgstr ""

#: ../installation/preparation.rst:17
msgid ""
"The archive contains a single ``galette-1.3.1`` directory, laid out as "
"follows:"
msgstr ""

#: ../installation/preparation.rst:35
msgid "What you have to copy on your server:"
msgstr ""

#: ../installation/preparation.rst:37
msgid ""
"the |folder| ``galette`` directory, **mandatory**: it holds the whole "
"application;"
msgstr ""

#: ../installation/preparation.rst:38
msgid ""
"the |folder| ``bin`` directory, **recommended**: it provides "
"the :doc:`command line interface <../command-line>`;"
msgstr ""

#: ../installation/preparation.rst:39
msgid ""
"the remaining files at the root of the archive are informational only; "
"Galette does not need them."
msgstr ""

#: ../installation/preparation.rst:44
msgid "Installation directory"
msgstr ""

#: ../installation/preparation.rst:46
msgid ""
"The :ref:`installation example <installation>` extracts the archive in ``/"
"var/www/galette-1.3.1``. This directory, which holds ``bin`` and "
"``galette``, is called the **installation directory** in this documentation. "
"Unless stated otherwise, paths such as ``config`` or ``data`` are relative "
"to its |folder| ``galette`` subdirectory: ``data`` stands for ``/var/www/"
"galette-1.3.1/galette/data``."
msgstr ""

#: ../installation/preparation.rst:48
msgid ""
"Keeping the version in the directory name is not mandatory, but it makes "
"updates easier: each release gets its own directory, next to the previous "
"one. Updating consists in copying your configuration and data into the new "
"directory, then pointing the web server to it - the previous version stays "
"untouched until you remove it. See :doc:`update <update>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../installation/preparation.rst:50
msgid ""
"The installation directory is created **outside** of the web server document "
"root (often ``/var/www/html``), on purpose: only the |folder| ``galette/"
"webroot`` directory should be reachable from the web."
msgstr ""

#: ../installation/preparation.rst:52
msgid ""
"If your host lets you choose the directory a domain or subdomain points to, "
"point it to ``galette/webroot``, as explained in :ref:`web server directory "
"exposition <installationsubdir>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../installation/preparation.rst:54
msgid ""
"Otherwise (some shared hostings), copy ``galette`` in the published "
"directory. Galette is then available at an URL like ``https://mydomain.tld/"
"galette/``, which redirects to ``https://mydomain.tld/galette/webroot/``. "
"The ``.htaccess`` files shipped in ``data`` directories prevent their "
"contents from being downloaded, but only with Apache: this is less secure "
"than exposing ``webroot`` alone."
msgstr ""

#: ../installation/preparation.rst:59
msgid "File permissions"
msgstr "Ovlasti za datoteke"

#: ../installation/preparation.rst:63
msgid ""
"A commonly used hack is to give all rights to everyone recursively on the "
"directory (``chmod 777``). This is a very very bad idea from a security "
"point of view. Please do not use that hack, you've been warned ;)"
msgstr ""
"Čest je prečac rekurzivno dodijeliti sva prava svima nad mapom (``chmod "
"777``). To je vrlo loša zamisao sa sigurnosnog stajališta. Nemojte je "
"koristiti; upozoreni ste ;)"

#: ../installation/preparation.rst:65
msgid ""
"Some Galette directories need specific rights. The application will need to "
"write in some of them, you have to ensure it will be possible. Here are "
"directories that need a write access:"
msgstr ""
"Neke Galetteove mape zahtijevaju posebne ovlasti. Aplikacija u neke od njih "
"mora zapisivati pa to trebate omogućiti. Mape koje zahtijevaju zapisivanje:"

#: ../installation/preparation.rst:67
msgid "|folder| `config` [#configdirperms]_,"
msgstr "|folder| `config` [#configdirperms]_,"

#: ../installation/preparation.rst:68
msgid "|folder| `data/attachments`,"
msgstr "|folder| `data/attachments`,"

#: ../installation/preparation.rst:69
msgid "|folder| `data/cache`,"
msgstr "|folder| `data/cache`,"

#: ../installation/preparation.rst:70
msgid "|folder| `data/exports`,"
msgstr "|folder| `data/exports`,"

#: ../installation/preparation.rst:71
msgid "|folder| `data/files`,"
msgstr "|folder| `data/files`,"

#: ../installation/preparation.rst:72
msgid "|folder| `data/imports`,"
msgstr "|folder| `data/imports`,"

#: ../installation/preparation.rst:73
msgid "|folder| `data/logs`,"
msgstr "|folder| `data/logs`,"

#: ../installation/preparation.rst:74
msgid "|folder| `data/photos`,"
msgstr "|folder| `data/photos`,"

#: ../installation/preparation.rst:75
msgid "|folder| `data/tempimages`,"
msgstr "|folder| `data/tempimages`,"

#: ../installation/preparation.rst:76
msgid "|folder| `data/templates_c`"
msgstr "|folder| `data/templates_c`"

#: ../installation/preparation.rst:78
msgid ""
"write access on ``config`` directory is only needed for Galette "
"installation, we advice you to remove the write access once Galette has been "
"installed :)"
msgstr ""
"Zapisivanje u mapu ``config`` potrebno je samo tijekom instalacije Galettea. "
"Preporučujemo uklanjanje tih ovlasti nakon instalacije :)"

#: ../installation/preparation.rst:81
msgid "Create database"
msgstr "Stvaranje baze podataka"

#: ../installation/preparation.rst:85
msgid "**Never use database root user!**"
msgstr "**Nikad ne koristite korisnika root za bazu podataka!**"

#: ../installation/preparation.rst:87
msgid ""
"For security reasons, it is strongly advised to rely on a specific user for "
"Galette database, and give him only requested access on the single Galette "
"database."
msgstr ""
"Zbog sigurnosti preporučuje se poseban korisnik za bazu Galettea, s "
"isključivo potrebnim ovlastima nad tom jednom bazom."

#: ../installation/preparation.rst:89
msgid ""
"For the example, we will use a database named `mygalette` with a user "
"`mygaletteuser` with `mypass` as password."
msgstr ""
"U primjeru koristimo bazu `mygalette`, korisnika `mygaletteuser` i lozinku "
"`mypass`."

#: ../installation/preparation.rst:91
msgid "MariaDB"
msgstr "MariaDB"

#: ../installation/preparation.rst:100
msgid "PostgreSQL"
msgstr "PostgreSQL"

#: ../installation/preparation.rst:108
msgid ""
"Those commands may vary, please refer to `MariaDB <https://mariadb.com/kb/en/"
"library/documentation/>`_ or `PostgreSQL <https://docs.postgresqlfr.org>`_ "
"documentations, or use a graphical tool:"
msgstr ""
"Naredbe se mogu razlikovati. Pogledajte dokumentaciju za `MariaDB <https://"
"mariadb.com/kb/en/library/documentation/>`_ ili `PostgreSQL <https://"
"docs.postgresqlfr.org>`_, ili koristite grafički alat:"

#: ../installation/preparation.rst:110
msgid "`phpMyAdmin <https://www.phpmyadmin.net>`_ for MariaDB ;"
msgstr "`phpMyAdmin <https://www.phpmyadmin.net>`_ za MariaDB;"

#: ../installation/preparation.rst:111
msgid ""
"`phpPgAdmin <http://phppgadmin.sourceforge.net>`_ or `PgAdmin <https://"
"www.pgadmin.org/download/?lang=fr_FR>`_ for PostgreSQL."
msgstr ""
"`phpPgAdmin <http://phppgadmin.sourceforge.net>`_ ili `PgAdmin <https://"
"www.pgadmin.org/download/?lang=fr_FR>`_ za PostgreSQL."

#: ../installation/preparation.rst:116
msgid "Web server directory exposition"
msgstr "Dostupnost mapa putem mrežnog poslužitelja"

#: ../installation/preparation.rst:120
msgid ""
"Galette installation may consists in copying a complete directory to a "
"location the web server can read. This method may work, but this exposes "
"from the web files and directories that should not be available this way."
msgstr ""
"Galette možete instalirati kopiranjem cijele mape na mjesto koje mrežni "
"poslužitelj može čitati. To može raditi, ali time putem interneta izlažete i "
"datoteke i mape koje ne bi smjele biti dostupne."

#: ../installation/preparation.rst:122
msgid ""
"It is possible to limit that by exposing only the ``webroot`` directory. All "
"other directories are more safe: it is not possible to reach them from the "
"web server!"
msgstr ""
"To možete ograničiti tako da izložite samo mapu ``webroot``. Ostale su mape "
"tada sigurnije jer im se ne može pristupiti putem mrežnog poslužitelja!"

#: ../installation/preparation.rst:124
msgid ""
"The examples below use ``/var/www/galette-1.3.1`` as :ref:`installation "
"directory <installationdir>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../installation/preparation.rst:128
msgid ""
"Exposing only ``webroot`` directory is the recommended, and only secured way."
msgstr "Izlaganje samo mape ``webroot`` preporučen je i jedini siguran način."

