#: ../installation/preparation.rst:257
msgid "FTP"
msgstr "FTP"

#: ../installation/preparation.rst:261
msgid ""
"Some archive or FTP software may corrupt files... It is strongly advised if "
"you use windows that you use `7zip <https://www.7-zip.fr>`_ to uncompress "
"and `FileZilla <https://filezilla-project.org/>`_ for FTP transfers."
msgstr ""
"Neki programi za arhive ili FTP mogu oštetiti datoteke. U sustavu Windows "
"preporučujemo `7zip <https://www.7-zip.fr>`_ za raspakiravanje i `FileZilla "
"<https://filezilla-project.org/>`_ za FTP prijenose."

#: ../installation/preparation.rst:263
msgid ""
"Once source code has been retrieved locally, use :samp:`tar xjvf "
"{galette.tar.bz2}` command under Linux/Unix/MacOS or a graphical tool under "
"Windows."
msgstr ""
"Nakon lokalnog preuzimanja izvornog koda u Linuxu/Unixu/macOS-u upotrijebite "
"naredbu :samp:`tar xjvf {galette.tar.bz2}`, a u sustavu Windows grafički "
"alat."

#: ../installation/preparation.rst:265
#, fuzzy
