msgstr "Posebni slučajevi"

#: ../installation/preparation.rst:279
msgid "Ionos"
msgstr "Ionos"

#: ../installation/preparation.rst:281
msgid ""
"If you're hosted on Ionos; and want to use a specific subdomain for Galette, "
"you must create your subdomain from their UI, and make it points to the "
"``webroot`` directory. You also have to edit the ``.htaccess`` file it "
"contains, and uncomment the ``RewriteBase /`` directive."
msgstr ""
"Ako koristite Ionos i želite zasebnu poddomenu za Galette, stvorite je u "
"njihovu sučelju i usmjerite na mapu ``webroot``. Uredite i datoteku "
"``.htaccess`` u toj mapi te uklonite oznaku komentara s direktive "
"``RewriteBase /``."

#: ../installation/preparation.rst:284
msgid "OVH"
msgstr "OVH"

#: ../installation/preparation.rst:286
