"računa <https://docs.ovh.com/fr/hosting/configurer-le-php-sur-son-"
"hebergement-web-mutu-2014/>`_."

#: ../installation/preparation.rst:288
msgid ""
"Additional information are available at: https://docs.ovh.com/fr/fr/web/"
