#: ../installation/preparation.rst:314
msgid "Windows"
msgstr "Windows"

#: ../installation/preparation.rst:316
msgid ""
"Installation described here rely on `XAMPP <https://www.apachefriends.org/"
"xampp-windows.html>`_; other installation methods exist but are not listed "
"here."
msgstr ""
"Ovdje opisana instalacija koristi `XAMPP <https://www.apachefriends.org/"
"xampp-windows.html>`_. Postoje i drugi načini, ali ovdje nisu navedeni."

#: ../installation/preparation.rst:318
msgid ""
"First of all, download XAMPP on your computer. Let's install it under ``C:"
"\\xampp``."
msgstr ""
"Najprije preuzmite XAMPP na računalo. U ovom primjeru instaliramo ga u ``C:"
"\\xampp``."

#: ../installation/preparation.rst:324
msgid ""
"Launch the ``xampp-control`` executable (you can find it in ``C:\\xampp``), "
"so you can start Apache and MySQL services."
msgstr ""
"Pokrenite izvršnu datoteku ``xampp-control`` u ``C:\\xampp`` kako biste "
"pokrenuli servise Apache i MySQL."

#: ../installation/preparation.rst:330
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "Once those steps done, download galette and move it to ``C:"
#| "\\wampp\\htdocs\\galette``, web application will be available from http://"
#| "127.0.0.1/galette/. Just visit this URL so the installation process begin."
msgid ""
"Once those steps done, download Galette, uncompress it and move the |folder| "
"``galette`` directory it contains to ``C:\\xampp\\htdocs\\galette``; web "
"application will be available from http://127.0.0.1/galette/. Just visit "
"this URL so the installation process begin."
msgstr ""
"Zatim preuzmite Galette i premjestite ga u ``C:\\wampp\\htdocs\\galette``. "
"Aplikacija će biti dostupna na http://127.0.0.1/galette/. Otvorite taj URL "
"za početak instalacije."

#: ../installation/preparation.rst:334
msgid ""
"Enabling PHP modules under XAMPP is done in ``xampp/php/php.ini``. Most of "
"the required extensions are already present, but commented (line begins with "
"a \";\"), just uncomment them and restart XAMPP."
msgstr ""
"PHP moduli u XAMPP-u uključuju se u ``xampp/php/php.ini``. Većina potrebnih "
"proširenja već je navedena, ali zakomentirana (redak počinje znakom „;”). "
"Uklonite oznaku komentara i ponovno pokrenite XAMPP."

#: ../installation/preparation.rst:336
msgid ""
"`openssl` extension is missing in the file, to activate it just add the "
"following to your `php.ini`: ``extension=php_openssl.dll``"
msgstr ""
"Proširenje `openssl` nedostaje u datoteci. Za uključivanje dodajte u "
"`php.ini`: ``extension=php_openssl.dll``"
